Z||000000||Cooter||03-06-2000||11:40 PM||||I just got the 95 Camaro seats put in my 88GT and they look great. I was going to sell the original seats because they need a little work and I now have no need to keep them. . . or do I? It seems that only 306 88's were built with the lumbar seat option and mine has it. The car has far too many miles to be a collectible jewel, so not keeping it original isnt a big deal. But what do I do with these seats? Keep them until they turn into dust or sell them to a kind forum member? Auction them on Ebay? Let the cat sleep in them. . . . ||||reg||1
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||03-06-2000||11:49 PM||||Sell 'em ...How much do you want for them ? What color are they ?... Sometimes I feel like a Fiero vulture...lol||||reg||1
