Z||000004||Earne||03-09-2000||01:42 AM||||Put them on eBay with a reserve price.  Tell everyone in your listing about the 306 limit and let the bidders make up your mind.  If you don't reach the reserve you can contact the high bidder anyway, or not.  If you do, at least you got enough to warrant selling them.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Monkeyman||03-09-2000||04:36 AM||||You could just give them away.  I volunteer to take them off of your hands.  I don't have a cat, so I could guarantee that the seats would NOT make a cat bed. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
